{"id":"7d0aefc635fe57fc","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-satisfaction.md","title":"Satisfaction","display":"df-satisfaction — Satisfaction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-satisfaction","aliases":["88-df-satisfaction"],"display":"df-satisfaction — Satisfaction","depends_on":["[[88-df-structure]]","[[88-df-assignment]]","[[88-df-formula]]","[[88-df-sentence]]","[[./88-df-term]]","[[88-df-term-interpretation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-satisfaction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-satisfaction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-satisfaction — Satisfaction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3a560d130315ebdc\" href=\"?note=3a560d130315ebdc\" title=\"88-df-structure\">88-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ecd5088fa3a87ce8\" href=\"?note=ecd5088fa3a87ce8\" title=\"88-df-assignment\">88-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"13ac48daafe6d04f\" href=\"?note=13ac48daafe6d04f\" title=\"88-df-sentence\">88-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b768b53c62ab02de\" href=\"?note=b768b53c62ab02de\" title=\"./88-df-term\">88-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bd75c125f807c9a0\" href=\"?note=bd75c125f807c9a0\" title=\"88-df-term-interpretation\">88-df-term-interpretation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-satisfaction-—-Satisfaction-$\\models$\">df-satisfaction — Satisfaction <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3a560d130315ebdc\" href=\"?note=3a560d130315ebdc\" title=\"88-df-structure\">88-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Asn}_S(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Asn}_S(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span> (assignment set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ecd5088fa3a87ce8\" href=\"?note=ecd5088fa3a87ce8\" title=\"88-df-assignment\">88-df-assignment</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span> (syntax sets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\">\\(\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\)</span> (relation-symbol classes)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> (sentence set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"13ac48daafe6d04f\" href=\"?note=13ac48daafe6d04f\" title=\"88-df-sentence\">88-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sat}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\varphi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sat}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\varphi)\\)</span> (satisfaction predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\n\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Asn}_S(\\mathfrak A)\\;\n\\begin{aligned}[t]\n&amp;\\forall t_1,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Sat}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,t_1=t_2)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\llbracket t_1\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}\n=\\llbracket t_2\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall P\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\;\n\\forall(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^n\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Sat}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,P(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\leftrightarrow\n(\\llbracket t_1\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta},\\ldots,\n\\llbracket t_n\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta})\\in P^{\\mathfrak A}\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Sat}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\neg\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{Sat}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\varphi)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Sat}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\varphi\\land\\psi)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Sat}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\varphi)\n\\land\\operatorname{Sat}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\psi)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Sat}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\forall x\\,\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak A)\\;\n\\operatorname{Sat}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\beta[a/x],\\varphi)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\n\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Asn}_S(\\mathfrak A)\\;\n\\begin{aligned}[t]\n&amp;\\forall t_1,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Sat}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,t_1=t_2)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\llbracket t_1\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}\n=\\llbracket t_2\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta}\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\geq1\\;\\forall P\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\;\n\\forall(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^n\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Sat}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,P(t_1,\\ldots,t_n))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\leftrightarrow\n(\\llbracket t_1\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta},\\ldots,\n\\llbracket t_n\\rrbracket_{\\mathfrak A,\\beta})\\in P^{\\mathfrak A}\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Sat}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\neg\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{Sat}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\varphi)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Sat}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\varphi\\land\\psi)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Sat}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\varphi)\n\\land\\operatorname{Sat}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\psi)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Sat}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\forall x\\,\\varphi)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall a\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\mathfrak A)\\;\n\\operatorname{Sat}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\beta[a/x],\\varphi)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta]\\bigr)\n\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Sat}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\varphi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta]\\bigr)\n\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Sat}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\varphi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\n\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A)\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\n\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Asn}_S(\\mathfrak A)\\;\n\\operatorname{Sat}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\varphi)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\n\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A)\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\n\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Asn}_S(\\mathfrak A)\\;\n\\operatorname{Sat}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\beta,\\varphi)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta]\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta]\\)</span> : 满足关系的记号缩写</li>\n<li>满足关系按公式构造深度递归；量词分支只在结构的实际论域上改动赋值。</li>\n<li>对句子，真值与赋值无关；无赋值下的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi\\)</span>明确要求\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>为句子，并用所有赋值表述该不变真值。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-satisfaction-—-Satisfaction-$\\models$","text":"df-satisfaction — Satisfaction $\\models$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"3a560d130315ebdc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"ecd5088fa3a87ce8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e14624569ca2194b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"13ac48daafe6d04f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"./88-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"b768b53c62ab02de","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./88-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-term-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"bd75c125f807c9a0","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · dep